+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| fridge | 90 | 0.300 | 0.430 | 0.335 | 150243 | 189625 |
+| washing_machine | 75 | 0.180 | 0.243 | 0.246 | 5204 | 4290 |
