crosses the heater threshold is now skipped instead of disabling the whole dw detector, requiring >=2 usable windows. (3) corrected the dw disable message, which claimed 'mark windows produced no heater runs' when the real cause was simply no dishwasher mark.\n\nSUBSET SCREEN (refit/house_10, refit/house_17, refit/house_6, ukdale/house_1, seed 2026): mean 0.364151 -> 0.365202, mw median 0.223885 -> 0.228612, kettle/fridge/wm/dw bit-identical (the dw and message edits are provably inert on this pool, since the _dw30_profile all-or-nothing branch never fired in 61 blocks). Fusion print fired: 262 plateau events -> 204 cycles.\n\nAUTHORITATIVE POOL RUN: primary 0.354848 vs floor 0.354623 (delta 0.000225), p10 0.340019, device_balanced 0.359466, house_1_v4 0.540104, medians kettle 0.55514 / mw 0.267281 / fridge 0.370963 / wm 0.242345 / dw 0.346705, 66 pairs / 20 houses, checksPass true.\n\nFULL-POOL PER-PAIR EVIDENCE:\nEXIT=0\npairs parsed: 330\n  AGGR kettle           P=0.5187 R=0.6191 F1=0.5426 gt=20445 pred=28999 n_pairs=60\n  AGGR microwave        P=0.3305 R=0.2891 F1=0.2744 gt=9440 pred=10675 n_pairs=55\n  AGGR fridge           P=0.4299 R=0.3342 F1=0.3676 gt=189625 pred=150243 n_pairs=90\n  AGGR washing_machine  P=0.2426 R=0.2458 F1=0.2334 gt=4290 pred=5204 n_pairs=75\n  AGGR dishwasher       P=0.4330 R=0.3182 F1=0.3475 gt=2635 pred=1488 n_pairs=50\n--- per-device (median F1 over pairs, mean P, mean R, total pred, total gt) ---\nfridge           n= 90 medF1=0.300 meanP=0.430 meanR=0.335 pred=150243 gt=189625\nwashing_machine  n= 75 medF1=0.180 meanP=0.243 meanR=0.246 pred=  5204 gt=  4290\nkettle           n= 60 medF1=0.620 meanP=0.519 meanR=0.620 pred= 28999 gt= 20445\nmicrowave        n= 55 medF1=0.230 meanP=0.330 meanR=0.289 pred= 10675 gt=  9440\ndishwasher       n= 50 medF1=0.500 meanP=0.432 meanR=0.318 pred=  1488 gt=  2635\n\nVerdict: below the +0.01 keep bar; the mw fusion is a real but narrow gain (it can only touch the fragmented houses), and the per-pair